flowchart LR
    IMG[Image file] --> Q{Quality gate: size, blur, brightness}
    Q -->|too poor| RV[Mark REVIEW: poor image quality]
    Q -->|ok| PRE[Preprocess: decode, EXIF rotate, resize]
    PRE --> YOLO[YOLO predict]
    YOLO --> NMS[NMS inside Ultralytics]
    NMS --> MAP[Map class_id to class name via manifest]
    MAP --> THR{Confidence band}
    THR -->|at or above accept threshold| ACC[accepted detection]
    THR -->|between conf and accept threshold| LOW[low-confidence detection, REVIEW]
    THR -->|below conf threshold| DROP[discarded]
    ACC --> OUT[DetectedObject records]
    LOW --> OUT
